* Circuit Netlist
V1 2 0 DC 10
V2 6 0 DC -10
I1 2 1 DC I1_value
IQ 1 5 DC IQ_value

M1 4 3 5 5 NMOS
M2 3 7 5 5 NMOS
M3 2 4 2 2 PMOS
M4 2 4 3 3 PMOS
M5 2 4 2 2 PMOS
M6 2 4 0 0 PMOS
M7 5 6 6 6 NMOS
M8 5 6 5 5 NMOS

C1 3 2 CMY_inf_val
RL 3 0 RL_value

* .MODEL statement would be needed here for NMOS and PMOS
* Example: .MODEL NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1) for a Level 1 model
* Example: .MODEL PMOS PMOS (LEVEL=1)